SYNC LOGIC (useStrumSync.ts):
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

- Subscribe to Tone.js Transport via Tone.Transport.scheduleRepeat
- Schedule each StrumBeat relative to bar start using beat position
- On mood change: switch pattern at the next bar boundary,
  NEVER mid-bar (prevents visual glitch)
- On BPM change: Tone.Transport handles it automatically,
  no manual recalculation needed
- On stop: reset currentBeat to 0, currentBar to 0
- Cleanup: cancel all scheduled events on unmount

CRITICAL timing rule:
  Use Tone.Transport.scheduleRepeat with interval "1m" (one measure)
  and inside it schedule each beat offset using Tone.Time arithmetic.
  NEVER use setInterval or setTimeout for beat sync.

